[h2] Going early access and what we have right now in early access[/h2]

[h3]Good day to everyone who reads us and is interested in our game The Wicked Days, thanks for the support!

Our game [b]The Wicked Days[/b] has finally released into early access on Steam!
A lot has changed since the old version that we were opening up for the free playtest. Some things we have changed completely and others we have added.

Lets see what we have got in this early access on this day:

[list]

[*] We have got our main hero Marvin Todds and his special abilities and we are working now on our second hero;

[*] We have got a new map, which is approximately 1 km x 1 km;

[*] The map now has telephone booths where the player is able to save his progress;

[*] Several melee weapons, including fire axe and chainsaw;

[*] Guns and handguns of different caliber;

[*] Several cars that you can drive, you can fix them with gears and fill with gas if the tank is empty;

[*] Zombies now might drop ammo or medkids, human enemies in addition to ammo and medkits might drop weapons;

[*] Armor system of light, medium and heavy armor;

[*] There are several boss fights;

[*] There are quest lines to get out of the place using different ways.

[*] The map has some secret places that are fun to explore

[*] There are some items hidden on the map that can give you new traits
[/list]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37787256/8a5d54146d174663fe50d80ac7d1a587037a50d5.jpg[/img]

In terms of early access, we would like to release big updates about every two months.

We have some plans for content for heroes and quests that we would like to implement first.

What we are working on right now:

[list]
[*] Fixing known bugs;

[*] Tweaking boss fights;

[*] ammo balance;

[*] A new quest line with mr. P;

[*] A new hero and hero's abilities;
[/list]

If you have encountered a but playing the game please don't forget to send us a bug report! You can do this either by pressing F10 or by using the duck icon on the left of the screen and pushing "bug report". The better you describe the situation, the better we can understand what might cause the problem.

You are welcome to our discord to hang out, ask questions and be closer to the development of the game![/h3]

